  "details": "Despawning a held item with Auto Hold enabled keeps the user’s input blocked until they release their grip. On desktop, this means right-clicking to be able to interact with objects again.\n\nAn example would be a recycle/trash bin with a trigger collider that returns a held item to a pool when it enters.\n\nThe fix is to manually call Drop(), but it would be nice if the behavior were consistent regardless of Auto Hold state.",
